[["Map",1,2,86,87,124,125,132,133],"articles",["Map",3,4,33,34,61,62],"astro-islands",{"id":3,"data":5,"body":13,"filePath":14,"digest":15,"rendered":16},{"title":6,"date":7,"summary":8,"tags":9,"draft":12},"Astro 岛屿架构入门",["Date","2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"],"为什么内容站适合用 Astro：默认零 JavaScript，需要交互的地方才加载。",[10,11],"Astro","前端",false,"## 什么是岛屿架构\n\nAstro 的岛屿架构，简单说就是「默认不加载 JavaScript」。页面在构建时就被渲染成静态 HTML，只有你显式标记的交互组件，才会在浏览器里被激活成一座座独立的小岛。\n\n## 为什么值得用\n\n对博客这类以内容为主的站点，它几乎是最优解：首屏快、SEO 友好、分享卡片正常，而需要交互的地方依然可以用熟悉的框架来写。\n\n```bash\nnpm create astro@latest\nnpx astro add vue\n```\n\n> 默认零 JavaScript，需要交互的地方才加载。\n\n## 迁移成本\n\n旧的 Vue 组件基本能直接复用，只需要决定哪些组件要加 `client:visible` 之类的加载指令。","src/content/articles/astro-islands.md","db71279534ef113c",{"html":17,"metadata":18},"\u003Ch2 id=\"什么是岛屿架构\">什么是岛屿架构\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Astro 的岛屿架构，简单说就是「默认不加载 JavaScript」。页面在构建时就被渲染成静态 HTML，只有你显式标记的交互组件，才会在浏览器里被激活成一座座独立的小岛。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么值得用\">为什么值得用\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>对博客这类以内容为主的站点，它几乎是最优解：首屏快、SEO 友好、分享卡片正常，而需要交互的地方依然可以用熟悉的框架来写。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">npm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> create\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> astro@latest\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">npx\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> astro\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> add\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> vue\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>默认零 JavaScript，需要交互的地方才加载。\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"迁移成本\">迁移成本\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>旧的 Vue 组件基本能直接复用，只需要决定哪些组件要加 \u003Ccode>client:visible\u003C/code> 之类的加载指令。\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":19,"localImagePaths":27,"remoteImagePaths":28,"frontmatter":29,"imagePaths":32},[20,23,25],{"depth":21,"slug":22,"text":22},2,"什么是岛屿架构",{"depth":21,"slug":24,"text":24},"为什么值得用",{"depth":21,"slug":26,"text":26},"迁移成本",[],[],{"title":6,"date":30,"summary":8,"tags":31},["Date","2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"],[10,11],[],"hello-blog",{"id":33,"data":35,"body":41,"filePath":42,"digest":43,"rendered":44},{"title":36,"date":37,"summary":38,"tags":39,"draft":12},"博客开工了",["Date","2026-09-06T00:00:00.000Z"],"记录「不可以已」搭建完成，以及接下来打算写什么。",[40],"随笔","## 为什么叫「不可以已」\n\n名字出自《荀子・劝学》：**学不可以已**。\n\n学习这件事没有终点，停下来就等于退步。做这个博客也是同样的心态：把折腾过的东西写下来，既是整理，也是继续往前走的记录。\n\n## 这个站会放什么\n\n- **技术文章**：前端工程化、Vue、JavaScript 实战\n- **小工具**：自己写的实用小玩意\n- **小游戏**：一些交互式的 Demo\n\n## 怎么发布一篇文章\n\n文章就是一个 Markdown 文件，写完推送即上线。\n\n> 保持好奇，持续折腾。","src/content/articles/hello-blog.md","24dbd4b89f4de3d3",{"html":45,"metadata":46},"\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么叫不可以已\">为什么叫「不可以已」\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>名字出自《荀子・劝学》：\u003Cstrong>学不可以已\u003C/strong>。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>学习这件事没有终点，停下来就等于退步。做这个博客也是同样的心态：把折腾过的东西写下来，既是整理，也是继续往前走的记录。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"这个站会放什么\">这个站会放什么\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>技术文章\u003C/strong>：前端工程化、Vue、JavaScript 实战\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>小工具\u003C/strong>：自己写的实用小玩意\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>小游戏\u003C/strong>：一些交互式的 Demo\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"怎么发布一篇文章\">怎么发布一篇文章\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>文章就是一个 Markdown 文件，写完推送即上线。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>保持好奇，持续折腾。\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n",{"headings":47,"localImagePaths":55,"remoteImagePaths":56,"frontmatter":57,"imagePaths":60},[48,51,53],{"depth":21,"slug":49,"text":50},"为什么叫不可以已","为什么叫「不可以已」",{"depth":21,"slug":52,"text":52},"这个站会放什么",{"depth":21,"slug":54,"text":54},"怎么发布一篇文章",[],[],{"title":36,"date":58,"summary":38,"tags":59},["Date","2026-09-06T00:00:00.000Z"],[40],[],"vue-composition-api",{"id":61,"data":63,"body":69,"filePath":70,"digest":71,"rendered":72},{"title":64,"date":65,"summary":66,"tags":67,"draft":12},"Vue 3 组合式 API 实践笔记",["Date","2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z"],"把逻辑按功能组织，而不是按选项类型堆在一起。",[68],"Vue","## 从选项式到组合式\n\n组合式 API 最大的变化不是语法，而是组织方式：把同一个功能的响应式状态、计算属性和副作用放在一起，而不是分散在 `data`、`computed`、`methods` 里。\n\n## 一个常见的封装\n\n```js\nexport function useCounter(initial = 0) {\n  const count = ref(initial);\n  const double = computed(() => count.value * 2);\n  const inc = () => count.value++;\n  return { count, double, inc };\n}\n```\n\n需要复用的逻辑抽成这样的函数即可，不必再依赖 mixin。","src/content/articles/vue-composition-api.md","4b3c9d3ce1122931",{"html":73,"metadata":74},"\u003Ch2 id=\"从选项式到组合式\">从选项式到组合式\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>组合式 API 最大的变化不是语法，而是组织方式：把同一个功能的响应式状态、计算属性和副作用放在一起，而不是分散在 \u003Ccode>data\u003C/code>、\u003Ccode>computed\u003C/code>、\u003Ccode>methods\u003C/code> 里。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"一个常见的封装\">一个常见的封装\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"js\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">export\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> function\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> useCounter\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">initial\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> count\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> ref\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(initial);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> double\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> computed\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(() \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=&gt;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> count.value \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">*\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> inc\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=&gt;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> count.value\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">++\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> { count, double, inc };\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>需要复用的逻辑抽成这样的函数即可，不必再依赖 mixin。\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":75,"localImagePaths":80,"remoteImagePaths":81,"frontmatter":82,"imagePaths":85},[76,78],{"depth":21,"slug":77,"text":77},"从选项式到组合式",{"depth":21,"slug":79,"text":79},"一个常见的封装",[],[],{"title":64,"date":83,"summary":66,"tags":84},["Date","2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z"],[68],[],"games",["Map",88,89,107,108],"dog-game",{"id":88,"data":90,"body":96,"filePath":97,"digest":98,"rendered":99},{"title":91,"status":92,"entry":93,"order":94,"summary":95},"修狗巨人","可玩","/game.html",1,"HTML5 Canvas 小游戏，键盘和触屏都能玩。","键盘和触屏都能玩的小游戏。","src/content/games/dog-game.md","cf659bcebfbf51e9",{"html":100,"metadata":101},"\u003Cp>键盘和触屏都能玩的小游戏。\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":102,"localImagePaths":103,"remoteImagePaths":104,"frontmatter":105,"imagePaths":106},[],[],[],{"title":91,"status":92,"entry":93,"order":94,"summary":95},[],"more-games",{"id":107,"data":109,"body":113,"filePath":114,"digest":115,"rendered":116},{"title":110,"status":111,"order":21,"summary":112},"更多小游戏","开发中","正在开发中，敬请期待。","正在开发中。","src/content/games/more-games.md","3d406a91bd3e710b",{"html":1